			<div class="content" id="post-content-4837066">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>A forest clearing in the swiss alps that works as a portal to a parallel-pocket-dimension if it's foggy</li>
<li>The pocket dimension is something like a paradise version of the original forest clearing</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>was discovered because a person got lost in the forest, accidently traveled in and out of the dimension and told in the village 3km nearby their experience</li>
<li>even thought there is no live in the dimension, in the middle of the forest clearing is an old ruin (only in the pd) indicating people living there centuries ago</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>It's not possible to feel negative emotions in the pd, so they forget life-essential actions like drinking, eating or sleeping. They don't notice injuries either.</li>
<li>the will to stay in the pd grows with the time</li>
<li>if anyone tries to force someone to exit the pd after they spent more than 13 min in it, they'll do everything just to stay there (it's the only exception of negative feelings).</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>My first try to write an SCP!</li>
<li>English is not my native language</li>
<li>I didn't knew I have to get a greenlight first to post it on drafts critique, so I already wrote a draft.</li>
<li>Let me know if this idea is already used in a better way somewherer else</li>
<li>thanks for criticizing my idea!</li>
</ul>

