														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4836865">
									

<p>Well, I figured that since it's a very predictable object stored at the largest facility it's probably used a lot in training. Not particularly impressive, and not something that most people think about much once they're done training, but something that most people know about. Kind of like how everybody learns to play &quot;Hot Cross Buns&quot; on the recorder in music class, but you don't play it any more once you learn any actual songs or a real instrument.</p>
<p>That, and I figured its historical importance should warrant <em>some</em> kind of notoriety in-universe.</p>

